 "summary": "A shrouded, keyed two-row pin header on a 2.54 mm grid in both directions, with straight 0.64 mm square brass pins, gold plated, for through-hole mounting. The black PBT housing (UL94V-0) carries a 4.5 mm polarising slot in the middle of one long wall and a triangle near one end of the same wall. The series runs from 2 × 3 to 2 × 30 positions; 2.54-2*10P is the 20-position (2 × 10) size. Rated 3 A, 550 V AC for one minute, -55 to 105 °C.",
